.TH RECIPE-HELPERS 7 "2026-11-08" "Recipe" "Recipe Helpers"
.SH NAME
recipe-helpers \- registered managed Rhai helpers
.SH DESCRIPTION
Helpers execute inside the configured Ginux domain. Paths refer to its assigned
filesystem; network access requires explicit invocation endpoint grants.
Readiness checks return ready(ctx) or needs_work(ctx, reason). Native errors fail
execution. Only ctx.state is restored between invocations.
